  "releaseNotes": "Skips and logs malformed product-query rows without an ItemCode while preserving paging; uses singular root resources and grouped Sales, Purchase, GeneralLedger, and Project hierarchies; adds typed currency, payment, customer-group, and product reference data; fixes take-aware paging and adds asynchronous streaming; reports incompatible successful JSON responses through DkPlusContractException; accepts customer-transaction enum fields returned as strings or numbers; maps nation-registry addresses to the shared Address model; and sends a trace-aware X-Correlation-Id with every DK Plus operation.",
